OL,5,G0230 Great British Railway Journeys
OL,6,     FDundee to Aberdeen: Michael
OL,7,     FPortillo travels from Dundee to
OL,8,     FAberdeen, stopping off at Glamis
OL,9,     FCastle, where the Queen Mother
OL,10,     Fgrew up, and making an excursion
OL,11,     Finto the Eastern Highlands.
OL,12,G0300 Great British Railway Journeys
OL,13,     FElgin to Loch Ness: Michael
OL,14,     FPortillo visits Lossiemouth and
OL,15,     FInverness. His journey ends at
OL,16,     FLoch Ness, where he joins a Deep
OL,17,     FScan research team searching for
OL,18,     Fthe elusive monster.
